invariant: INV-14
file: srv.c
catches: srv_auth_test
reason: ch_srv_check accepts a cookie_key or ticket_key that ch_srv_accept
  refuses, such as a key of all zero bytes that nothing filled. The
  operator then learns of it at the first client, not at boot.
  test/srv_identity_tests.h's check_keys_case rows require CH_EINVAL.

--- old
    if (live == 0 || !srv_identities_usable(cfg) || !keys_ok(&cfg->srv)) {
--- new
    if (live == 0 || !srv_identities_usable(cfg)) {
